          "description": "Resolves with the result when the job completes and rejects when it fails or is cancelled (cancellation rejects with an AbortError). Created on first access, so a job nobody awaits never raises an unhandled rejection. The continuation runs after the frame step that settled the job; read Job.result for same-frame access."
